// stands, concept panel 5; read by rv/world/room_look.hpp, which documents the format): an arcade after dark, the
// building's darkest room but never a black hole from the hub (the step's review). A dark stained parquet under dark
// plum walls, walnut trim, cabinets and cases on a dark varnished wainscot, graphite shelving and frames, black
// plastics, a leather armchair, cases lined in navy; the neon a hot pink that glows on its wall and blooms more than
